portrait.description:
@thomasbennie_ (instagram)

Well, my friend and I had just came from a seminar about being a photographer on Instagram and being able to sell yourself as a brand. We headed to the tallest point in the Johannesburg Municipality for a spectacular sunset and boy is he amazing with the camera!

Funny enough we had just met at that seminar physically but socially we met via Instagram. We have been buddies since!
